{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0079-s001", "text": "I ett bostadsaktiebolag har du skyldighet att", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0079-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.300933837890625, "generation_seconds": 16.23978724796325, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0080-s001", "text": "Betala bolagsvederlag och eventuellt även finansieringsvederlag för bostadsaktiebolagets lån till bostadsaktiebolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0080-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.100680272108843, "peak": 0.30352783203125, "generation_seconds": 39.619257796090096, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0080-s002", "text": "Vederlagen används till att sköta bostadsaktiebolaget, till exempel underhålla byggnaderna och gårdsområdet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0080-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.34149169921875, "generation_seconds": 35.489367799134925, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0082-s001", "text": "Se till att din bostad hålls i gott skick.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0082-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.264251708984375, "generation_seconds": 16.83009889605455, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0083-s001", "text": "I förväg meddela till bostadsaktiebolagets disponent eller styrelse om du ska göra en sådan ändring i din bostad som kan påverka husets bärande konstruktioner, vattenledningar, fuktisolering, elledningar eller ventilationssystem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0083-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 18.877823129251702, "peak": 0.34661865234375, "generation_seconds": 68.5701955021359, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0083-s002", "text": "Till exempel ska en badrumsrenovering alltid meddelas i förväg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0083-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.345428466796875, "generation_seconds": 18.500874389894307, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0084-s001", "text": "Genomföra renoveringar på ett sådant sätt att bygganden inte tar skada.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0084-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.25567626953125, "generation_seconds": 20.428379802033305, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0084-s002", "text": "I Finland finns exakta bestämmelser till exempel om hurdant tätskikt ett badrum ska ha.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0084-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.26470947265625, "generation_seconds": 24.89010963891633, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0085-s001", "text": "Meddela bostadsaktiebolaget eller disponenten, i praktiken vanligtvis allra först fastighetsskötseln, om det finns ett sådant fel i din bostad vars åtgärdande åligger bostadsaktiebolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0085-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.74312925170068, "peak": 0.39739990234375, "generation_seconds": 44.534279198851436, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0086-s001", "text": "I ett bostadsaktiebolag har du följande rättigheter:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0086-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.282562255859375, "generation_seconds": 16.760434728115797, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0087-s001", "text": "Förvalta den bostad vars aktier du äger.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0087-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.31634521484375, "generation_seconds": 14.195632235147059, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0087-s002", "text": "Du får göra ändringar i din bostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0087-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.32574462890625, "generation_seconds": 10.167980784084648, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0087-s003", "text": "Tänk på att renoveringen inte får medföra olägenhet till bostadsaktiebolaget eller de andra aktieägarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0087-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.290679931640625, "generation_seconds": 25.22631555912085, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0089-s001", "text": "Hyra ut din bostad eller en del av den till en annan person.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0089-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.244049072265625, "generation_seconds": 17.74610908003524, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s001", "text": "Delta i stämmor och på dem påverka det som händer i bostadsaktiebolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.28338623046875, "generation_seconds": 19.60827424400486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s002", "text": "På en stämma kan du rösta om olika saker och kräva att ett ärende tas upp för behandling på stämman.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.3387451171875, "generation_seconds": 25.004077930003405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s003", "text": "Bostadsaktiebolaget ska se till att husets konstruktioner, isolering, värmesystem, elledningar, vattenledningar och avlopp samt gårdsområden hålls i gott skick.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.374693877551021, "peak": 0.404754638671875, "generation_seconds": 35.83636370790191, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s004", "text": "På stämman fattas beslut om reparationer gällande dessa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.344482421875, "generation_seconds": 17.236171847907826, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s005", "text": "I vissa bostadsaktiebolag har man beslutat att fördela ansvaret på ett annat sätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.304412841796875, "generation_seconds": 21.443208005977795, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0090-s006", "text": "I detta fall står det i bolagsordningen vem som ansvarar för vad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0090-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.300384521484375, "generation_seconds": 17.731218694942072, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0091-s001", "text": "För bostaden anges två priser i försäljningsannonsen: försäljningspriset och det skuldfria priset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0091-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.251922607421875, "generation_seconds": 30.14182423101738, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0091-s002", "text": "Det verkliga totalpriset för bostaden är det skuldfria priset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0091-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.383270263671875, "generation_seconds": 19.606436040019616, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0091-s003", "text": "Försäljningspriset anger för vilket belopp du kan köpa bostaden, men utöver det betalar du bostadsaktiebolagets lån med bolagsvederlaget, vilket kan höja boendekostnaderna avsevärt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0091-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.116190476190477, "peak": 0.355499267578125, "generation_seconds": 47.67308299592696, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0092-s001", "text": "I ett bostadsaktiebolag är bolagsvederlaget oftast en stor kostnadspost.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0092-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.340179443359375, "generation_seconds": 30.78611524007283, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0092-s002", "text": "Bolagsvederlaget påverkas i synnerhet av bostadens storlek, renoveringar och huruvida bostadsaktiebolaget själv äger tomten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0092-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.271270751953125, "generation_seconds": 45.252621865132824, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0092-s003", "text": "När du köper en bostad, ska du kontrollera om bolaget äger tomten eller om det är en hyrestomt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0092-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.2525634765625, "generation_seconds": 31.504150670021772, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0093-s001", "text": "Om du inte är medborgare i ett EU- eller EES-land och du ska köpa en fastighet med tillhörande tomt, behöver du vanligtvis ett tillstånd för detta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0093-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.722993197278912, "peak": 0.3026123046875, "generation_seconds": 47.49297793302685, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0093-s002", "text": "Ansök om tillståndet hos försvarsministeriet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0093-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.278778076171875, "generation_seconds": 15.19498238991946, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0094-s001", "text": "Om du ska köpa en bostadsaktie behöver du inget tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0094-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.27642822265625, "generation_seconds": 16.155414746142924, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0094-s002", "text": "Du behöver inte heller något tillstånd om du ska köpa en fastighet tillsammans med din make eller maka eller sambo som är medborgare i ett EU- eller EES-land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0094-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.140952380952381, "peak": 0.3350830078125, "generation_seconds": 39.75320848193951, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0095-s001", "text": "Enligt lagen måste den som säljer bostaden berätta om de fel som han/hon känner till innan försäljningen av bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0095-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.279754638671875, "generation_seconds": 29.917684769956395, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0095-s002", "text": "Om det står klart att försäljaren har känt till fel i bostaden utan att berätta om detta för köparen, kan säljaren tvingas ersätta köparen för felet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0095-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.817414965986394, "peak": 0.2943115234375, "generation_seconds": 40.44784993887879, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0096-s001", "text": "Det kan också finnas dolda fel i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0096-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.348419189453125, "generation_seconds": 10.621289144968614, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0096-s002", "text": "De är fel som ingen känner till.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0096-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.29620361328125, "generation_seconds": 9.066751366946846, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0096-s003", "text": "Dolda fel är ofta till exempel fuktproblem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0096-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.319427490234375, "generation_seconds": 13.147930126171559, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0096-s004", "text": "Säljaren måste betala ut en ersättning till köparen ifall det i bostaden finns ett allvarligt fel, som skulle ha påverkat bostadsköpet ifall man känt till det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0096-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.305034013605443, "peak": 0.41455078125, "generation_seconds": 36.64486293098889, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0097-s001", "text": "När du köper en bostad måste du också betala överlåtelseskatt (varainsiirtovero).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0097-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.27325439453125, "generation_seconds": 21.41665643500164, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0097-s002", "text": "Om du köper en bostadsaktie är överlåtelseskatten 1,5 procent av bostadens skuldfria pris.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0097-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.28411865234375, "generation_seconds": 33.20271950797178, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0097-s003", "text": "Om du köper en fastighet är skatten 3 procent av bostadens skuldfria pris.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0097-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.265045166015625, "generation_seconds": 25.675883802818134, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0098-s001", "text": "Köpebrevet är ett kontrakt där t.ex. bostadens pris, bostadens storlek, bostadens skick och datumet då köparen får tillgång till bostaden finns inskrivet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0098-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.341217041015625, "generation_seconds": 46.875559714855626, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0098-s002", "text": "Vanligen görs köpebrevet upp av banken eller bostadsförmedlaren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0098-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.33099365234375, "generation_seconds": 23.203820613911375, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0098-s003", "text": "Köparen har rätt att läsa köpebrevet före dagen då köpet genomförs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-agarbostad/narration/hb-c11-u0098-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.383026123046875, "generation_seconds": 17.67388079990633, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
